     *  corrects is the number of the claim a correction corrects (null when it is not one); roundsBy
     *  is the date its live figures round by against the sheet's policy date (its own date, or for a
     *  correction the date of the claim it corrects); dueBy is the date it is due by, fixed when it was
     *  added; log is its status log, oldest first, one line per status it has had; deferredUntil is
     *  the date it was deferred until (null when it never was); proofs is how many proofs were added
     *  to it; splitFrom is the number of the claim it was split off (null when it was not); lockedBy is
     *  the user whose open editor locks it (null when no one's does); lateEntry is whether it was
     *  added while its period was soft-closed; remindedOn is the last day a reminder was written for it
     *  (null when none was); ref is its external reference (null when it has none); tags are its tags,
     *  sorted (empty when it has none); voidReason is the reason it was voided with (null when none
     *  was given); comments are its comments, oldest first, each as <user> on <date>: <text>; batch
     *  is the number of the settle batch that settled it (null when a bulk settle did not); lines are
     *  its lines, oldest first, each as <label> <qty> x <unit> (empty when it has none). */
    public record ClaimView(Long id, Long personId, String amount, LocalDate date, String note,
            ClaimStatus status, String number, String settledDue, String openedBy, boolean stated,
            String statedDue, String corrects, LocalDate roundsBy, LocalDate dueBy, List<String> log,
